\newlabel{fig:modes-atlas}{{3}{17}{\textbf {Eigenshape atlas.} Median displacement fields for modes~1--15 rendered in the anterior--posterior view. Modes~1--3 correspond to quasi-rigid rotations about the CC, ML, and AP axes, respectively. Mode~9 exhibits an inlet-opening pattern preferentially recruited under LAB; mode~10 is its asymmetric near-degenerate partner with deformation localised around the pubic symphysis}{figure.3}{}}
